{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "03d28001a43e98bfbec59d19edfce9f0f025aaf78cc311c7d94197a60e4f7b4a", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n恵美の撮影は順調に進み、いったん休憩となった）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄日。惠美的拍摄顺利进行，暂时进入了休息时间）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "b3fa2bfe0a1075bb89f32ec1a783c97e29ce31f56bbc5c4f2ca4a84aba11d04b", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま～。\nどうだった？　アタシの登校シーン！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～。\n怎么样？我上学的场景拍得如何！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5e538efcd5f1e5a47feb711d3584fa135d3c6d12c6ed5cbfece04ef82bb23482", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったぞ。やっぱり現役の\n女子高生だからかな、すごく自然に撮れてたよ。", "zh": "啊，非常棒。果然是因为你还是现役女高中生吧，拍得特别自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c34d3b4360ea9aa183348185a05e62f5e93cf792c60393343954c709fcb0b43", "ja": "にゃはは♪　ならよかった！\nアタシ、こう見えてチャリ通だからね。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪　那就好！\n我这个样子看不出来吧，其实可是骑自行车上学的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "eca98ff4cb5b95b3fbcd40781475b04fd593ea872b15620be69f25e2e400001a", "ja": "あれ、恵美は自転車通学だったっけ？", "zh": "哎，恵美是骑自行车上学的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "40d2bcd088669bf366c6cf7c62ccefe8abdd1e9e0f45220740f721670332af1b", "ja": "家から駅までチャリで、その後は電車！\nでも、ほとんど毎日乗ってるよ♪", "zh": "从家到车站是骑自行车，之后再坐电车！\n不过，我差不多每天都会骑哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0648a0023e4de301e54cc2159c93facce326718782bc753f0c21c0648be9d642", "ja": "なるほど。今日みたいに\n天気がいい日は、気持ちいいだろうな。", "zh": "原来如此。像今天这样天气好的日子，骑起来一定很舒服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "cc8b98cef320ccf5908f84d37fe6136d44ee419f5c511809232bef650dab1a80", "ja": "うん、天気のいい日はめっちゃ気持ちいいよ～。\nあ、でも雨降ったら最悪だけど。", "zh": "嗯，天气好的日子超级舒服哦～。\n啊，不过要是下雨的话就糟透了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "3a1c6440f500916bf33cf8d8c1281bbf2100b8d0f99f48be07d202607e2a99d2", "ja": "朝から雨ならバス使うんだけど、\nこの前、急に降られてさー。", "zh": "要是早上就下雨的话我会坐公交，\n但上次突然被淋到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "69e270f3fa148aa9ee65994178cdf7eb9c3c4c97e2cdf6de73ee97adbefe1e2d", "ja": "髪もメイクも、グチャグチャになっちゃって。\n制服もカバンも濡れるし、ホント大変だったよ！", "zh": "头发和妆都变得乱七八糟的。\n校服和书包也都湿透了，真的特别狼狈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "36179b9230ba37ebf4075c6a94639d8516f452f890f44f85f627a2879b17797a", "ja": "それは大変だったな……\n自転車通学、やめようとは思わないのか？", "zh": "那可真够辛苦的……\n没想过要放弃骑自行车上学吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "4e12d358ac8b0327e2e534e3772b1f485b9d392dce07693bbeee05dd6fd61565", "ja": "全然！　大変なコトもあるけど、\nやっぱチャリ好きだしね♪", "zh": "才不会！虽然也有辛苦的时候，但我果然还是喜欢骑车嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "2f9100fdd64329c06180ec462bd8c207da2c602619816f097208161309b3a75c", "ja": "そだ、{$P$}！\n今度の週末にサイクリング行かない？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}！\n下个周末要不要一起去骑自行车？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "2ccc2866b53a2a85e87380239fda3468697d4b892c1b56b65130038b3058285d", "ja": "運動不足だって言ってたでしょ？\nチャリなら準備とか必要ないし♪", "zh": "你不是说运动不足吗？骑自行车的话，也不需要准备什么♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d83d731dc7e65bdde2f0dc45ea0a559fe87032000e0e2b759db5cd47fd57a90c", "ja": "サイクリングか、いいな。でも\n今度の週末は、雨が降ると聞いたような……。", "zh": "骑行吗，听起来不错。不过\n我好像听说这周末会下雨……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "136c6462425cfb257798458a9e506d29802ca24d1c7b9dc5b5344fc521fad0b0", "ja": "え～、そうなの！？\n天気って、ホント空気読めないよね～。", "zh": "诶～，真的吗！？\n天气真是一点都不会看气氛呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "6b2f1dbde76a5b8d1f3d8edd1cda4ae48198bd3311384b78b5b6a8208fb6d59f", "ja": "ま、いっか、降ったら降ったで、その時考えよ！\nとりあえず決定ね♪", "zh": "嗯，算了，下雨了再到时候想办法吧！\n总之就这么决定啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d4cd1da6e376c9edf3f6b234a13e3147755529f1d9498937c6e5f09757ac16b4", "ja": "貴重な休日なのに、\nそんな行き当たりばったりでいいのか？", "zh": "明明是难得的休息日，\n这样临时起意地安排真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "ecf3579ae854c5e919253f7018d4266158647cdb252359e5e609a389a17412c8", "ja": "いいからいいから。\nこういうのはノリが大事なんだって！", "zh": "好啦好啦。\n这种事就是要看气氛和感觉嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0173_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "33e1bfdf7b63dd1328638b109390895cdb242b6ce093c79ac70b570b6314e79a", "ja": "んじゃ、約束！　楽しい週末のためにも、\nお仕事がんばろーね！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "那就这么说定啦！为了过个开心的周末，\n工作也要加油哦！喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
